WEBVTT

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:32.528
We're less likely to consider
the role of our imaginations.

00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:35.990
In many parts of our life,
we are really great at imagining.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.620
Things like vacations
or dream homes or career moves.

00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:44.874
These exercises in imagination
help us define what it is we want.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.794
They allow us to flirt
with what's possible

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:50.421
before having to make any decisions.

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:53.382
And they're also innately pleasurable,

00:00:53.424 --> 00:00:56.177
even if those fantasies
never actually materialize.

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:59.305
Imagination is such a powerful tool.

00:00:59.347 --> 00:01:03.643
So when it comes to sex, why isn't it
one of the first ones that we reach for?